      "comment": "Mitya: Project Mistilteinn",
      "content": "Project Mistilteinn, run in the Armory Palace under Pierro, seeks a weapon capable of harming the Heavenly Principles. Mitya extracted and reverse-engineered energy from Stellar Linchpins to make Anti-Celestia Energy. Progress needs huge amounts of Kresnik Kristall, hence Project Stuzha.\n\nRonova's curse killed researchers whenever the project neared a breakthrough. By 7.1 the curse was lifted and Mitya reports the project can continue.",
