    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Curse of Death",
        "Ronova's mark",
        "Ruler of Death"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Mitya"
      ],
      "comment": "Mitya: Ronova's Curse of Death",
      "content": "The Curse of Death kills everyone near a technological breakthrough, then revives them without memory. Days in the afterlife amount to only minutes in the real world. Mitya, who carved her symbol into his hand while dead, keeps his memories and a trace of her authority.\n\nIn 7.1 Mitya learned the Ruler of Life also takes part, that the Heavenly Principles monitors the Rulers periodically, and that repeated deaths erode memory and eventually the soul.",
