      "key": [
        "Valeriy"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Mitya",
        "scarf",
        "Armory Palace"
      ],
      "comment": "Mitya: Valeriy",
      "content": "Valeriy, the Armory Palace guard, keeps Mitya on schedule and fetches him back to work; Mitya dodges him to visit the theater, once timing his escape to Valeriy's inspection to the minute. Valeriy died in the theater afterlife, where Mitya mourned him as a friend, but returned to life with the others; in 7.1 he backs Mitya's theater plan with military support.",
