      "comment": "Mitya: The Korolevskiy Theater and Podvorye Restaurant",
      "content": "Mitya seeks inspiration at the theater and eats at Podvorye. He met Vodyanitsa there before the blizzard events. In 7.1 he planned to turn the theater into a laboratory, using its Ley Line problems to evade Ronova's blockade.",
